        "Signs of water damage (soft floor near tub/toilet)",
        "Vanity and mirror condition",
        "Faucet and plumbing (leaks, water pressure)",
        "Ventilation fan (working? Mold risk if not)",
        "GFCI outlets",
        "Tile condition (loose, cracked, discolored)"
