        "Water stains on ceiling below (if upstairs bath)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "living_room",
      "label": "Living Room",
      "items": [
        "Flooring condition",
        "Walls (cracks, patches, water stains)",
        "Windows (open/close, locks, seals, condensation)",
        "Electrical outlets (enough? Working?)",
        "Fireplace (if present - damper, flue, mantle)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bedrooms",
      "label": "Bedrooms",
