        "Door condition (hinges, latch, frame)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "basement",
      "label": "Basement/Crawlspace",
      "items": [
        "Water intrusion signs (stains, efflorescence, musty smell)",
        "Foundation cracks (horizontal = serious, vertical = common settling)",
        "Sump pump (present? Working? Battery backup?)",
        "Electrical panel location and condition",
        "Water heater age and condition (check data plate)",
        "HVAC system age and condition",
        "Ductwork condition",
        "Plumbing pipes (material? Leaks? Corrosion?)",
        "Insulation in rim joists",
        "Radon mitigation system present?",
        "Signs of pests (droppings, gnaw marks)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "attic",
