        "Signs of animal intrusion",
        "Electrical wiring type (knob and tube?)",
        "Structural integrity (rafters, trusses)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "garage",
      "label": "Garage",
      "items": [
        "Garage door opener age/condition",
