        "Structural integrity",
        "Auto-reverse safety test on door"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "electrical",
      "label": "Electrical System",
      "items": [
        "Panel brand (Federal Pacific or Zinsco = replace immediately)",
        "Panel amperage (100A minimum, 200A preferred)",
        "Breaker condition (any double-tapped?)",
        "Outlet types (2-prong = no ground, needs updating)",
        "GFCI protection in wet areas",
        "AFCI protection in bedrooms (code requirement)",
        "Knob and tube wiring present?",
        "Aluminum wiring present (1965-1973 homes)?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "plumbing",
      "label": "Plumbing System",
      "items": [
